度後來居上。 The a16z Show a16z Inside Cursor: The Anatomy of a Generational Startup Cursor AI 編程 創業策略 企業銷售 人才收購 產品哲學 self-serve back channel talent via acquisition monorepo\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-27-a16z-不做模型不早卖企业-用界面和速度赢下巨头/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">39:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>不做模型不早賣企業，用界面和速度贏下巨頭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cursor 的成功不是靠自研模型，而是把產品本身當護城河：不做插件、不早進企業、不自己訓模型，靠迭代速度、招聘哲學和創始人密度後來居上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Cursor</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 編程</span>\n</div></div></a>"]